# Default game; once play has resumed after the first stoppage, the tracer
# forces the goal phase (3) so the goal sequence and the goal scoreboard (12,
# coach comment) load. Then Start back to the faceoff.
@screen 1 +200 P1 START
#poke @screen 5 +200 FFC60C.w=0
#poke @screen 5 +200 FFC60A.w=3
@screen 12 +300 P1 START
@screen 12 +400 P1 START
@screen 5 #2 +300 END
